body.p:
This Form RS specifies the information that submitting parties must provide when making a reasoned submission for a pre-notification referral under Article 4(4) or (5) of Council Regulation (EC) No 139/2004 of 20 January 2004 on the control of concentrations between undertakings (
            80
         ) (hereinafter referred to as ‘the Merger Regulation’).

Your attention is drawn to the Merger Regulation and to Commission Regulation (EC) No 802/2004 (
            81
         ) (hereinafter referred to as ‘the Implementing Regulation’), to which this Form RS is annexed. The text of those regulations, as well as other relevant documents, can be found on the Competition page of the Commission’s Europa website. Your attention is also drawn to the corresponding provisions of the Agreement on the European Economic Area (
            82
         ) (hereinafter referred to as ‘the EEA Agreement’).

Article 287 of the Treaty and Article 17(2) of the Merger Regulation, as well as the corresponding provisions of the EEA Agreement (
            83
